### ====================================================================
### MedCare Plus Hospital Appointment System - REST API Test Collection
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api/v1

### 1. [Task 3] GET All Appointments (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. [Task 3] POST Create New Appointment (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientName": "Samantha Reed",
  "doctorName": "Dr. Sarah Jenkins",
  "date": "2026-09-05",
  "timeSlot": "10:30 AM",
  "status": "confirmed",
  "reason": "Cardiology post-surgery evaluation"
}

###

### 3. [Task 3 & 4] GET All Doctors (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4. [Task 5] POST Real MongoDB Operation - Create Patient in Atlas (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Michael Chang",
  "email": "michael.chang.atlas@medcareplus.com",
  "phone": "+1-555-8899",
  "bloodGroup": "B+",
  "age": 29
}

###

### 5. [Task 5] GET Real MongoDB Operation - Find All Patients from Atlas (200 OK)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 6. [Task 5] POST Valid Patient Schema Test (200 OK)
POST {{baseUrl}}/test/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "patient",
  "payload": {
    "name": "David Miller",
    "email": "david.miller@example.com",
    "phone": "+1-555-0199",
    "bloodGroup": "O+",
    "age": 34
  }
}

###

### 7. [Task 5] POST Invalid Blood Group Test - Validation Failure (400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/test/validate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "patient",
  "payload": {
    "name": "Invalid Patient",
    "email": "invalid@medcareplus.com",
    "bloodGroup": "INVALID_TYPE"
  }
}

###

### 8. [Task 3] GET Trigger 500 Unhandled Error Test (Global Error Handler)
GET {{baseUrl}}/test/trigger-error
Content-Type: application/json
